14
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:40,010
Italy lost twice and couldn't advance.

15
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:42,090
For the Argentina match,

16
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:46,970
even with a draw, Argentina advances on goal difference.

17
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,770
But we need a victory.

18
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:53,770
Let's win and go to the final.

19
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:58,480
- Let's do this.
- Let's show them our strength.

20
00:02:59,610 --> 00:03:01,070
Let's go, guys.

21
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:02,780
Let's be among the finalists.

22
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,740
Okay!

23
00:03:05,410 --> 00:03:06,580
Tsubasa.

24
00:03:07,790 --> 00:03:10,910
The decisive match is about to begin.

25
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
A draw isn't enough for Japan.

26
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:19,050
Japan - Argentina

27
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:17,380
They have to beat the fearsome Argentina.

28
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:19,960
If they want to advance.

29
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,180
The key point is to watch the man who scored 5 against Italy,

30
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:25,180
Argentina's national treasure,

31
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:30,060
Juan Diaz, whom some call the best of the century.

32
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,560
And the man who accepts this challenge,

33
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:37,360
