34
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:40,440
All hopes of stopping Juan Diaz rest on his shoulders.

35
00:03:41,690 --> 00:03:44,240
Genius against genius, get ready.

36
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,570
The match begins.

37
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:50,450
I never thought Japan would beat Italy.

38
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:53,580
They scored two magnificent goals against Hernandez.

39
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:56,080
I guess football has developed in Asia.

40
00:03:57,130 --> 00:03:59,340
Now everyone knows Japan.

41
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,300
But they can't beat Argentina.

42
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:04,720
They have the genius Juan Diaz.

43
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:08,050
It will be a real shame if Japan can't make the top four.

44
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:11,100
What? Japan will advance today.

45
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:13,730
You don't know what you're talking about.

46
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:15,230
Hey, Azumi.

47
00:04:19,230 --> 00:04:22,780
It seems Japan won the coin toss.

48
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:25,280
Hey, Japan's number 10.

49
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:29,700
I know you learned those South American tricks from Roberto Hongo.

50
00:04:29,780 --> 00:04:32,500
I'm looking forward to our match today.

51
00:04:32,910 --> 00:04:34,000
What?

52
00:04:34,290 --> 00:04:37,920
Roberto Hongo? Wait...

53
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:39,880
Do you know Roberto?

54
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:42,340
He's my coach's friend.

55
00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:44,510
He was in the locker room today.

56
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,760
Today?

57
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:48,590
Yes, the match is starting.

58
00:04:51,310 --> 00:04:53,350
What's wrong, Tsubasa-kun?

59
00:04:53,930 --> 00:04:55,100
Roberto...

60
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:56,020
What?

61
00:04:56,770 --> 00:05:00,190
Roberto is in this stadium!

62
00:05:03,690 --> 00:05:06,150
And the match begins.

63
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:10,740
Together with Germany and Uruguay, France,

64
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:17,290
