65
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:18,540
Let's go.

66
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:19,670
Okay!

67
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,960
The Japan team wants to win this match.

68
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:25,510
And they fiercely want to score the first goal.

69
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:26,420
Tsubasa-kun.

70
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:30,260
The ball goes to playmaker Ozora Tsubasa-kun.

71
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:34,640
Roberto is watching from the stands.

72
00:05:34,890 --> 00:05:36,230
Tsubasa, be careful.

73
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:39,440
It's not good to daydream in the middle of a match.

74
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,270
Nice.

75
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,400
What?

76
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:47,990
Diaz-kun reads Tsubasa-kun's game and catches the ball in the air.

77
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:50,990
What great intuition the genius Juan Diaz-kun has.

78
00:05:51,910 --> 00:05:54,200
Alright, let's go, Pascal.

79
00:05:54,290 --> 00:05:57,460
Okay, we're not looking for a draw.

80
00:05:57,540 --> 00:06:01,250
We want to advance with a perfect victory.

81
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:05,250
And we want to win this tournament with a great record.

82
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:07,260
- Forward!
- Hurry!

83
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:09,630
It's starting.

84
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:12,140
This is how the Italian defense was shattered...

85
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:14,760
The combination play is constantly changing.

86
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,520
What?

87
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,940
Skillful passing in a tight space.

88
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,440
Pascal.

89
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:25,940
Diaz.

90
00:06:27,940 --> 00:06:31,280
Until a local club discovered us,

91
00:06:31,410 --> 00:06:33,620
we didn't even have money to buy a ball.

92
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:37,160
We kicked almost everything.

93
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:41,330
But that allowed our combination play to develop.

94
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:43,330
It's impossible for anyone to stop this.

95
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:46,840
Look at those little guys! They're stopping them on their own.

96
00:06:47,210 --> 00:06:50,760
Giant Jito-kun goes to stop the two small guys.

97
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:53,800
Diaz-kun passes back.

98
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:56,850
And goes right under Jito-kun.

99
00:06:56,930 --> 00:06:58,060
What?

100
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:03,190
Great, Pascal.

101
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,060
Catch.

102
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,770
The ball returns to Diaz-kun.

103
00:07:07,980 --> 00:07:09,280
I'll handle this.

104
00:07:09,610 --> 00:07:11,280
Get him, Matsuyama.

105
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:14,030
Matsuyama-kun makes a strong tackle.

106
00:07:15,030 --> 00:07:16,700
Diaz-kun jumps.

107
00:07:18,790 --> 00:07:19,620
What?

108
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:23,670
He uses his opponent's foot to jump even higher.

109
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:29,170
And passes to the other forward Brown-kun.

110
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:30,880
You can't catch the ball.

111
00:07:30,970 --> 00:07:31,800
What?

112
00:07:32,130 --> 00:07:34,010
Final pass, catch!

113
00:07:34,090 --> 00:07:36,300
He returns it to the unmarked Diaz-kun.

114
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,810
I'll never let you pass.

115
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:40,270
What?

116
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:41,480
He passed.

117
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:44,270
He's doing flip and reverse flip moves!

118
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,900
And now he shoots!

119
00:07:51,990 --> 00:07:56,620
Goal! Wakashimazu-kun stretches but can't catch it.

120
00:07:58,410 --> 00:07:59,410
We did it.

121
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:02,910
In the first minute, Argentina scores the first goal.

122
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:07,500
And what a magnificent goal, an acrobatic shot from Diaz.

123
00:08:07,590 --> 00:08:10,550
And a wonderful combination play with Pascal-kun.

124
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:13,930
They truly are Argentina's Golden Duo.

125
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:16,050
Great, Diaz.

126
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:17,800
Your pass was great too, Pascal.

127
00:08:18,050 --> 00:08:20,310
Diaz-kun maintains his form.

128
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:23,940
With this goal, he ties with Schneider-kun and Napoleon-kun

129
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:28,730
