130
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:35,320
This is definitely a tough start for Japan, who desperately need a victory.

131
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:36,820
They scored on us.

132
00:08:36,910 --> 00:08:39,580
What a magnificent goal it was.

133
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:41,540
Don't get discouraged, guys.

134
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:43,870
The match has just begun.

135
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,210
It starts from here.

136
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:50,550
Guys, okay. Guys, we're doing it again.

137
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:51,500
Okay.

138
00:08:51,590 --> 00:08:53,300
The game starts from here.

139
00:08:53,590 --> 00:08:55,720
And we're back to midfield.

140
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:58,300
The Japan team is ready and wants to make up for it.

141
00:08:58,590 --> 00:09:00,390
Good, one more goal.

142
00:09:00,470 --> 00:09:01,310
Okay.

143
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,970
We can't lose.

144
00:09:03,060 --> 00:09:05,980
Roberto is watching from the stands.

145
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:08,560
I have to make up for this, now or never.

146
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:10,860
Tsubasa-kun.

147
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,610
Tsubasa.

148
00:09:13,230 --> 00:09:17,820
Japan wants to advance with the Golden Duo Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun?

149
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:22,830
Argentina has Diaz and Pascal, Japan has those two.

150
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:26,790
Tsubasa-kun is still shocked because of Roberto.

151
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:27,830
So it's better...

152
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:29,080
Catch.

153
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:30,080
Misaki-kun.

154
00:09:30,170 --> 00:09:33,050
Misaki-kun decides not to do a combination play with Tsubasa-kun.

155
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:35,840
Instead, he passes to Hyuga-kun on the other side.

156
00:09:35,970 --> 00:09:37,630
Good, let's go Hyuga.

157
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,840
We trust you.

158
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:40,220
You'll never get past.

159
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:43,220
Hyuga-kun escapes the tackle with a spin.

160
00:09:43,470 --> 00:09:44,850
Thanks for the ball.

161
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:46,730
And Diaz-kun is here.

162
00:09:46,810 --> 00:09:50,400
Pascal-kun unbalances him and Diaz-kun gets the ball.

163
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,360
This is a typical Argentine play.

164
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,320
Where's the hurry.

165
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:55,280
Hyuga-kun pushes him aside with strength.

166
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,860
He didn't give up on that ball.

167
00:09:57,110 --> 00:10:01,200
But key defender Galvan-kun quickly strikes the spinning ball.

168
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,120
What?

169
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:06,120
Argentina has a very tough defense.

170
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:09,210
They give the ball to Diaz-kun again.

171
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:10,250
Alright.

172
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:13,290
Tsubasa-kun goes after him, will there be a one-on-one between the two stars?

173
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:14,380
Tsubasa!

174
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,710
You're a midfielder too, right?

175
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:19,220
Look around before you attack.

176
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:21,720
Let's save our face-off for later.

177
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,890
What?

178
00:10:23,890 --> 00:10:28,060
Diaz-kun doesn't collide with Tsubasa-kun and passes.

179
00:10:28,140 --> 00:10:31,020
Diaz-kun is so fast! Does he run 50 meters in 5 seconds?

180
00:10:31,190 --> 00:10:32,270
Catch.

181
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,280
He gets past with a feint.

182
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,610
Great.

183
00:10:39,950 --> 00:10:43,320
He jumps at high speed! He leaps toward the ball.

184
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:45,540
He flips toward the ball.

185
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:48,710
And using the rolling momentum, he shoots.

186
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:50,210
Wakashimazu!

187
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:53,170
This time Wakashimazu-kun reacts, it's right in his path.

188
00:10:53,250 --> 00:10:54,090
What?

189
00:10:54,170 --> 00:10:55,460
The ball went with spin.

190
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:57,880
Goal!

191
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:02,760
He shot while rolling and put spin on the ball.

192
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:05,760
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

193
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:10,970
Born: January 25 | Height: 164 cm | Weight: 51 kg | Blood Type: O

194
00:11:12,180 --> 00:11:15,010
And Argentina's golden boy Juan Diaz

195
00:11:15,090 --> 00:11:19,640
scores his second goal in this match.

196
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:21,980
7 goals in total.

197
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:25,770
Currently at the top of the scoring charts.

198
00:11:26,230 --> 00:11:28,190
Amazing, that's Diaz.

199
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,490
They're essentially winning this match.

200
00:11:30,780 --> 00:11:33,360
No, we're two goals behind.

201
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:36,450
Our next opponent is Argentina.

202
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:40,700
A painful goal for Japan.

203
00:11:40,790 --> 00:11:42,500
They can't attack.

204
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:44,670
And whenever the opponent gets the ball, they score.

205
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:46,630
This is definitely the worst-case scenario.

206
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:49,170
Their rhythm is broken.

207
00:11:49,340 --> 00:11:51,710
The opponent controls the game.

208
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:56,930
They must find a way out of this situation.

209
00:11:58,010 --> 00:12:01,310
If they continue like this, they'll score more than against Italy.

210
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:04,640
South American teams are also very scary.

211
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:07,900
We must be careful in tomorrow's Uruguay match.

212
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,570
Pull yourselves together!

213
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:13,900
How are you representing Japan?

214
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,530
Wakabayashi.

215
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,530
Wakabayashi-kun.

216
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,660
Wakabayashi.

217
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:24,330
I got too caught up in Roberto and this happened.

218
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:27,880
I... must do something.

219
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:31,170
Tsubasa-kun, don't rush.

220
00:12:31,750 --> 00:12:34,920
I'll try to open a path with dribbling.

221
00:12:35,010 --> 00:12:40,470
I don't know how well I'll do against their skillful play, but I'll support you.

222
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:42,680
Misaki-kun...

223
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:49,650
I can't let Argentina show off again.

224
00:12:51,900 --> 00:12:54,030
Now the game resumes.

225
00:12:54,650 --> 00:12:57,240
Japan tries to make up for the goal.

226
00:12:57,320 --> 00:13:00,160
Using Misaki-kun's great dribbling skill to open a path.

227
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:04,790
How far will Misaki-kun's French football go against Argentina?

228
00:13:05,370 --> 00:13:07,080
Great, come on Misaki.

229
00:13:07,170 --> 00:13:08,170
Advance.

230
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:11,040
Even though Japan is behind, their fans still cheer enthusiastically from the stands.

231
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:21,260
And this is a quick steal! Diaz-kun again.

232
00:13:21,350 --> 00:13:22,260
Misaki-kun.

233
00:13:22,350 --> 00:13:24,310
Come on, number 10.

234
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:27,770
He also gets past Tsubasa-kun.

235
00:13:27,850 --> 00:13:31,310
And what a humiliation for Tsubasa-kun, he passes the ball between his legs.

236
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:33,900
Was that all your strength?

237
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,030
Final shot...

238
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:38,860
Come on!

239
00:13:39,570 --> 00:13:41,530
And this is a long shot.

240
00:13:43,330 --> 00:13:44,790
This is a Drive Shot!

241
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:48,830
Goal! Third goal!

242
00:13:48,920 --> 00:13:53,710
Diaz-kun scores by imitating Tsubasa-kun's shot.

243
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,960
Argentina's genius.

244
00:13:56,050 --> 00:14:00,590
Juan Diaz-kun completes a hat-trick in the 10th minute of the first half.

245
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:02,050
I did it!

246
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:03,300
Nice shot!

247
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:07,350
Words are inadequate.

248
00:14:07,430 --> 00:14:09,480
What a phenomenon Juan Diaz is!

249
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:11,690
As long as he's here, I think it's safe to say:

250
00:14:11,770 --> 00:14:16,070
Favorites Argentina will be the champions of the tournament.

251
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:21,410
I am the one who will lead Argentina to the world championship.

252
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:24,200
The first page of the Juan Diaz legend

253
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:28,000
is now being written at the International Youth Tournament in France.

254
00:14:28,450 --> 00:14:32,580
Now Japan's chance of advancing seems zero.

255
00:14:33,170 --> 00:14:36,590
I guess I couldn't expect more from an Asian team.

256
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:41,340
It doesn't matter that the coach is from the Brazilian national team.

257
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:42,760
What matters is the raw material.

258
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:47,470
Our football talent is on a different level, that's all.

259
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:55,060
Why am I panicking?

260
00:14:55,150 --> 00:15:00,490
That's right, I'm not playing football for Roberto.

261
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:03,910
I'm playing for myself...

262
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:07,540
And I'm playing for us.

263
00:15:08,370 --> 00:15:09,500
Tsubasa.

264
00:15:10,330 --> 00:15:11,660
We're three goals down.

265
00:15:11,750 --> 00:15:16,000
I think giving them a 3-goal advantage is enough, right guys?

266
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:18,420
What?

267
00:15:21,670 --> 00:15:25,390
We're three goals down, we have to make up for it.

268
00:15:25,930 --> 00:15:27,560
We have no other choice.

269
00:15:27,810 --> 00:15:28,640
Right.

270
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:31,430
We can't change the goals we conceded.

271
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:33,560
Now we'll make up for them.

272
00:15:34,150 --> 00:15:35,190
Hyuga.

273
00:15:35,270 --> 00:15:36,310
Matsuyama.

274
00:15:36,610 --> 00:15:39,730
Right, we must not give up yet.

275
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:42,780
We made a promise to each other that night.

276
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:45,160
I haven't forgotten it.

277
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:50,450
We've come this far, it's too late to turn back.

278
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:51,910
Hyuga.

279
00:15:52,210 --> 00:15:55,040
The run has already started.

280
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:58,590
Right, and our goal is the world.

281
00:15:58,670 --> 00:16:00,630
We can't go back.

282
00:16:02,170 --> 00:16:05,010
Tsubasa was always at the center and we competed with him.

283
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:07,470
But now we've all become one team.

284
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:11,060
No matter how tough it is, this team can reach the top.

285
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:13,350
We can beat the world!

286
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:17,520
Then, for Japan to become number one in the world,

287
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:21,860
let's win this tournament, guys.

288
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:23,190
Okay!

289
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:27,780
We might be tired, but we don't give up.

290
00:16:27,950 --> 00:16:32,000
We'll keep fighting to become number one in the world.

291
00:16:34,370 --> 00:16:35,790
And play resumes.

292
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:41,420
Japan is now three goals behind, will they find a way to make up for it?

293
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:43,800
- I trust you, guys.
- Good luck, guys.

294
00:16:44,010 --> 00:16:46,130
These three goals were my fault.

295
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:49,010
I have to take them back, I'll make up for it myself!

296
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:53,680
Tsubasa-kun, no single player is responsible for three conceded goals.

297
00:16:53,770 --> 00:16:57,980
If you're going to blame someone, blame the team.

298
00:16:58,060 --> 00:16:59,190
Don't push yourself too hard.

299
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,610
Misaki-kun.

300
00:17:01,570 --> 00:17:03,190
Okay, let's go.

301
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:05,070
We trust you, Tsubasa.

302
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:07,570
Argentina is on fire.

303
00:17:07,660 --> 00:17:12,290
To stop them, we must stop Diaz.

304
00:17:12,410 --> 00:17:14,330
I'll get past him.

305
00:17:14,540 --> 00:17:16,750
I see you insist on facing him, Tsubasa-kun.

306
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:18,960
Then I'll support you.

307
00:17:19,210 --> 00:17:20,710
Bring it on, Diaz.

308
00:17:21,630 --> 00:17:23,460
So, what happened to being 3 goals down?

309
00:17:23,550 --> 00:17:29,550
Is this just talk, or have the goals made you lose your mind?

310
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:31,510
I won't lose to you.

311
00:17:34,470 --> 00:17:38,520
Tsubasa-kun attacks alone, but Diaz-kun is after him.

312
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:40,150
- Tsubasa!
- Diaz!

313
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,810
In midfield.

314
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:44,400
A show unfolds between the two stars.

315
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:47,700
He who controls the midfield controls the game.

316
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:54,580
But if Tsubasa loses here, Japan really can't win.

317
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:56,540
That's it.

318
00:17:56,750 --> 00:17:59,210
This looks like the move he used to get past Tsubasa.

319
00:17:59,290 --> 00:18:02,540
A soft touch and nutmeg.

320
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:06,420
Gotcha, I knew you'd do that.

321
00:18:06,630 --> 00:18:09,180
And I did it on purpose.

322
00:18:09,340 --> 00:18:12,680
But Diaz-kun reads his hand and takes the ball.

323
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:15,600
Oh, but Tsubasa-kun reads his hand too.

324
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,850
He goes forward without striking.

325
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:19,190
You...

326
00:18:21,060 --> 00:18:23,520
Diaz doesn't give up and stretches his leg.

327
00:18:23,610 --> 00:18:26,650
Tsubasa-kun falls down and the ball is lost.

328
00:18:30,910 --> 00:18:33,160
Misaki-kun picks it up.

329
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:34,240
What?

330
00:18:34,330 --> 00:18:35,910
Your support from behind was great, Misaki.

331
00:18:36,290 --> 00:18:37,660
Misaki-kun.

332
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:41,040
That's right, all the guys are behind me.

333
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:46,590
Not only Tsubasa-kun, for the first time in this match,

334
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:49,300
they outsmarted the genius Diaz-kun.

335
00:18:49,630 --> 00:18:50,800
Diaz.

336
00:18:51,470 --> 00:18:52,430
Damn it.

337
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:54,930
Don't worry Diaz, it was a coincidence.

338
00:18:55,010 --> 00:18:56,930
I'll handle it.

339
00:18:57,310 --> 00:18:59,430
Now Pascal-kun attacks.

340
00:18:59,770 --> 00:19:00,940
Tsubasa-kun.

341
00:19:01,190 --> 00:19:02,690
Okay, Misaki-kun.

342
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:08,360
Japan's Golden Duo is on the move.

343
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:10,320
They got past in the blink of an eye.

344
00:19:10,610 --> 00:19:11,570
What?

345
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:13,820
- Great, Tsubasa!
- Misaki!

346
00:19:13,910 --> 00:19:16,160
That's it! Keep going!

347
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:18,200
Japan finally found its rhythm.

348
00:19:18,370 --> 00:19:23,920
Hyuga-kun and Nitta-kun, Japan's two forwards, and Ishizaki-kun overlapping forward.

349
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,840
I'm here.

350
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:29,420
He thinks our football is limited.

351
00:19:29,550 --> 00:19:30,970
He might be right to some extent.

352
00:19:31,090 --> 00:19:33,720
But our style...

353
00:19:34,510 --> 00:19:37,760
It may not be like South America or Europe, but our football comes from Asia.

354
00:19:38,430 --> 00:19:41,730
That is, from Japan.

355
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:44,730
Tsubasa-san.

356
00:19:44,810 --> 00:19:45,810
Watch and learn.

357
00:19:45,900 --> 00:19:49,530
This is the football of Japan youth!

358
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:53,280
Drive shot coming, go execute the plan.

359
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:54,160
Okay.

360
00:19:54,860 --> 00:20:00,540
The Drive Shot comes either from the top right or top left.

361
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:02,120
We just have to guess the direction.

362
00:20:02,210 --> 00:20:05,330
And stop it without underestimating its power.

363
00:20:06,420 --> 00:20:08,420
What kind of defensive formation is this?

364
00:20:08,710 --> 00:20:09,800
Nice.

365
00:20:11,090 --> 00:20:12,340
Come on!

366
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:15,510
He takes a decisive Drive Shot.

367
00:20:15,590 --> 00:20:18,890
But it's not going to goal! Is there a mistake?

368
00:20:18,970 --> 00:20:19,930
What?

369
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:23,430
No, it's a spinning pass to Hyuga-kun.

370
00:20:23,810 --> 00:20:25,440
This is yours, Hyuga-kun.

371
00:20:25,730 --> 00:20:27,400
Tsubasa showed he trusts me.

372
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:31,030
He turned his Drive Shot into a spinning pass.

373
00:20:31,110 --> 00:20:33,700
I must repay this favor by scoring.

374
00:20:33,780 --> 00:20:36,360
The spinning pass comes straight down from above.

375
00:20:36,450 --> 00:20:38,200
I have to adjust to it.

376
00:20:44,290 --> 00:20:45,250
Right here.

377
00:20:45,330 --> 00:20:48,500
Hyuga-kun wants to volley it!

378
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:50,380
- What?
- Hyuga!

379
00:20:50,630 --> 00:20:53,590
Adjusting to its speed is almost impossible.

380
00:20:53,670 --> 00:20:55,430
If this becomes a goal,

381
00:20:55,510 --> 00:20:59,720
Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun, the two pillars of Japanese middle school football,

382
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:02,390
will truly become a super golden pair!

383
00:21:02,890 --> 00:21:04,480
Scoring this ball is the only way.

384
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:08,310
It opens the door to becoming a true scoring forward for the Japan team.

385
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,650
Come on!

386
00:21:12,070 --> 00:21:16,150
Tiger Shot!

387
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:26,750
Goal! Japan finally scores the first goal.

388
00:21:26,830 --> 00:21:28,420
An overwhelming comeback with pure willpower!

389
00:21:28,670 --> 00:21:29,920
Amazing!

390
00:21:32,210 --> 00:21:34,300
Yes! We scored 1 goal!

391
00:21:34,420 --> 00:21:36,670
Tsubasa! Hyuga!

392
00:21:37,090 --> 00:21:39,680
Good, we've made up one goal.

393
00:21:40,050 --> 00:21:42,720
Ozora Tsubasa, Kojiro Hyuga.

394
00:21:42,810 --> 00:21:45,430
This is the first super golden pair unity.

395
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:48,900
It consisted of a spinning pass and a tiger shot.

396
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:51,190
Spinning Tiger Shot!

397
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:53,690
Your shot was great, Hyuga-kun.

398
00:21:54,110 --> 00:21:56,360
Your pass was great, Tsubasa.

399
00:23:46,290 --> 00:24:49,990
NEXT EPISODE: JAPAN YOUTH FIGHTS BACK